@startuml
title Proposed authorized delivery sequence
actor Human
participant CLI
participant Coordinator
participant Governance
database SQLite
participant Git
participant GitHub
Human -> CLI : Explicit publish for approved unit
CLI -> Coordinator : Validate manifest and exact source
Coordinator -> Governance : Recheck design, quality and scoped grant
Governance --> Coordinator : Authorized or blocked
alt authorized
Coordinator -> SQLite : Acquire existing lease and persist push intent
Coordinator -> Git : Approved non-force branch push
Coordinator -> GitHub : Observe exact remote branch SHA
Coordinator -> SQLite : Record observed push outcome
Coordinator -> GitHub : Find all matching PR states
alt one matching open PR
Coordinator -> SQLite : Reconcile immutable PR identity
else no match
Coordinator -> SQLite : Persist create intent
Coordinator -> GitHub : Create PR from verified evidence
Coordinator -> GitHub : Reconcile result or ambiguous response
Coordinator -> SQLite : Record identity and append evidence
else conflicting, closed or merged PR
Coordinator -> SQLite : Record blocked recovery decision
end
else blocked
Coordinator --> CLI : Structured unmet requirements
end
@enduml
